  unitName: Dragon Raptor
  unitId: 51192
  unitNumber: 1630
  description: A race of dragons native to the otherworldly Valdroa. All members
    of this race are born as warriors, and have extremely combative natures. Raptors
    are believed to view all beings not of their race as enemies, attacking any and
    all they encounter on sight. However, this contrasts with their responses to
    the immense monoliths scattered across Valdroa; the Raptors seem to view these
    monoliths with fear and awe, worshiping them from a set distance. Raptor legends
    hold that these monoliths are essentially the keystones of the world, and that
    the monoliths' destruction will lead to the end of the world.
  summonDesc: We do not...permit... Anyone...to approach the monoliths... It is...ancient
    law...
  fusionDesc: Power...growing... I...sense it... This is...the monolith's...blessing...
